# Last matching pattern wins. Deliberately no catch-all: an unowned path needs
# no code-owner approval, which is what lets the apps release push its
# appVersion bumps and other PRs merge without a second person. Ownership here
# is a gate, so only gate what needs gating.

# Production-facing paths need an explicit code-owner review before a pull
# request touching them can merge. Enforced by the "PRD Promotion Review Gate"
# repository ruleset (require_code_owner_review).
/charts/*/values-prd.yaml @jdwillmsen
/argocd/prd/ @jdwillmsen
